.TH SIGMA_DIFFERENCE 1 2000-1月 "genome.delta_star_islands" "genome.delta_star_islands"
.SH NAME
genome.delta_star_islands \- The sliding window \fBdelta*\fR profile of the genome against its own global
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIgenome.delta_star_islands(\fBgenome\fR as <generic> FastaSeq, 
\fBwindowSize\fR as integer = 50000, 
\fBstepSize\fR as integer = 5000);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The sliding window \fBdelta*\fR profile of the genome against its own global
 average genome signature: the alien DNA that has not yet been ameliorated
 shows a signature deviating from the host average and therefore appears as
 peaks on the curve (e.g. the pathogenicity islands).
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBgenome\fB \fR\- the genome nucleotide sequence. 
.PP
.PP
\fBwindowSize\fB \fR\- the sliding window size in bp, default = the paper's 50kb contig size. 
.PP
.PP
\fBstepSize\fB \fR\- the sampling step in bp. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
the profile rows ordered by the site position
.PP
